  "toKS4": "There is no GCSE or other examination in the core PE programme; Years 10 and 11 follow the National Curriculum KS4 entitlement. Pupils tackle demanding activities that build personal fitness and a healthy lifestyle, refine tactics, improve technique, take part in further outdoor challenges, evaluate performance and keep taking part in sport outside school. The school's Year 10 and 11 lessons (exercise and wellbeing, safe HIIT, lifelong activity and leadership) address this. No exam board unit references apply.",
